  {
    "id": "ship_reflex",
    "category": "ship",
    "title": "Reflex",
    "game_id": 87847,
    "content": "Created for efficient, long distance travel. Records suggest the structure of this vessel has been repurposed numerous times as automated processes sought to adapt to an increasingly hostile environment. \r\n\r\nAs a result, the original intention behind this hull design has been lost to the millennia and data corruption has obscured even whether this design originates from a human or artificial mind. However, the data streams which led to this vessel's development have their origins in the K4T-Y region. (placeholder)",
    "tags": "corvette,reflex,long-range,fuel-efficient,jump",
    "aliases": "reflex corvette"
  },
  {
    "id": "ship_reiver",
    "category": "ship",
    "title": "Reiver",
    "game_id": 87848,
    "content": "A small, durable combat vessel. (Placeholder)",
    "tags": "corvette,reiver,combat,agile",
    "aliases": "reiver corvette"
  },
  {
    "id": "ship_stride",
    "category": "ship",
    "title": "Stride",
    "game_id": 91106,
    "content": "A frame stripped for range, built to leap between stars.\r\nThe design bears apparent alterations \u2014 conduits rerouted through spaces that seem improvised, geometries bent into configurations that defy intuition.\r\nNo signature remains to mark its maker.",
    "tags": "corvette,stride,jump,long-range,explorer",
    "aliases": "stride corvette"
  },
  {
    "id": "ship_carom",
    "category": "ship",
    "title": "Carom",
    "game_id": 91107,
    "content": "A hull shaped for distance and solitude. The proportions are spare, stripped of anything not essential to the crossing. The drive assembly carries unexpected mass \u2014 bracing layered over bracing, housings reinforced beyond apparent need, structure filling spaces the original geometry left hollow. What necessity shaped these adaptations remains unclear.",
    "tags": "corvette,carom,jump,ultra-range",
    "aliases": "carom corvette"
  },
